# -------------------------------------------------------------
# SLRJ LEARN - GMAIL SMTP CONFIGURATION
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-side Environment Variables (Required for Contact Form Email)
# 
# 1. GMAIL_USER: The Gmail address used to send emails
# 2. GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD: 16-character Google App Password
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# 2. Generate a 16-character Google App Password:
#    a. Go to Google Account (https://myaccount.google.com)
#    b. Navigate to 'Security' -> Enable '2-Step Verification'
#    c. Search for 'App Passwords' (https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
#    d. Create an App Password named "SLRJ Website"
#    e. Copy the 16-character code (without spaces) and set GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD below.
# 3. For Production Deployments (Vercel / Netlify / Custom Server):
#    Add GMAIL_USER and GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD in your hosting provider's Environment Variables settings.
# -------------------------------------------------------------

GMAIL_USER=slrj.digital@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password_here
